@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
hide footbox
actor "Pengguna" as P0
participant "OverviewView" as P1
participant "Ringkasan data" as P2
participant "Firestore / lokal" as P3
P0 -> P1: Buka dashboard
P1 -> P2: Minta data sesuai role
P2 -> P3: onSnapshot PO / baca lokal
P3 --> P2: Data atau belum tersedia
P2 --> P1: Metrik dan daftar PO
P0 -> P1: Pilih tahap PO
P1 -> P1: Saring daftar terbaru
P0 -> P1: Pilih satu pesanan
P1 --> P0: Buka panel detail PO
P3 --> P2: Perubahan data PO
P2 --> P1: Perbarui rincian aktif
@enduml